        {
          "topic": "Scope",
          "instructions": "Four sourced accuracy configurations and four authored policies. Change the deadline, slot count, timing estimates, compatibility assumption or bookings. Adapt the app for a different required workload. All starting timings are unmeasured estimates."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Starting values",
          "instructions": "Prefilled values are fictional examples. Changing part of the workbook can leave example inputs in the case."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Editing",
          "instructions": "Edit the named input sheets. Keep worksheet names, column headers and record identifiers. Do not add formulas. Other case inputs remain unchanged."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Units and time",
          "instructions": "Elapsed integer minutes from campaign start. All example durations are illustrative, unmeasured planning estimates, not published vLLM runtimes. Supply setup and teardown in the reserved duration."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Import",
          "instructions": "Upload this workbook, inspect the changes and diagnostics, then apply. Importing does not calculate results or establish operating permission."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Parameters",
          "instructions": "Editable inputs. Supply the declared case inputs. Published rules and other case context are retained."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Bookings",
          "instructions": "Editable inputs. Supply the declared case inputs. Published rules and other case context are retained."
        }
